/**
 * Tests for poll/feature-review-cycle.ts (T4 — Feature Reviewer Daemon)
 *
 * Covers:
 *   1. classifyFileOverlap — no overlap returns hasOverlap: false
 *   2. classifyFileOverlap — overlap returns hasOverlap: true with correct files
 *   3. No new commits (ahead_by === 0) → emits feature_review_no_drift; skips
 *   4. New commits, no file overlap → calls tryAutoRebase (task-level path)
 *   5. Auto-rebase clean → emits feature_review_rebased; pushes
 *   6. Auto-rebase conflict → escalates; emits drift_escalated
 *   7. File overlap, no Anthropic key → escalates directly
 *   8. File overlap, semantic analysis: confidence ≥ threshold → auto-rebase
 *   9. File overlap, semantic analysis: confidence < threshold → escalate
 *  10. Slack set → drift_slack_sent emitted
 *  11. Slack absent → drift_slack_skipped emitted
 *  12. feature_status not in_handoff → skipped entirely
 *  13. drift_detected already true → skipped
 *  14. No feature_branch_base_sha → skipped
 *  15. No githubToken → emits feature_review_skipped
 *  16. GitHub compare API error → non-fatal; emits feature_review_compare_failed
 */

